{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_title", "source_sha256": "3ce8f3b35980e2aa29f0d1099968262598b1b3cbc8ba8032e389f7293ba6f7ee", "ja": "目指せ！　正統派アイドルちゃん！？", "zh": "目标是正统派偶像宝贝！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_synopsis", "source_sha256": "61d9b68992bbbaa1505180237a90eb907db34c9b2ef4966593d049fd31208fc2", "ja": "正統派アイドルの研究という名目で雪歩に\nつきまとう亜利沙。その最中、亜利沙は自分\n自身もアイドルである事実に気付かされる。\nそんな亜利沙を、プロデューサーは\n定期公演のセンターに任命するのだった。", "zh": "亚利沙以研究正统派偶像的名目，\n一直纠缠雪步不放。\n过程中，亚利沙被点醒了\n自己也是偶像的事实。而制作人\n也决定任命亚利沙为定期公演的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "960c9da5181c507e6cc2c3c75c7ea1e508708ad12ce0007e669127fa44cebd0a", "ja": "みなさぁーんっ！　今日はありがとうございます！\n本当の本当に、ありがとうございまーす！！", "zh": "大家──！今天很谢谢你们！\n真的真的，非常谢谢你们──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "3d2158393ab93ce6e04e55dfe9e0abfe41b8ea0f7d01c4b3ea962a33bfa616a2", "ja": "ありさの歌が、みなさんのコールでひとつになって……\n本当に、最高のステージでしたー！", "zh": "亚利沙的歌声和大家的Call融合在一起……\n这场表演真是太棒了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1037_null", "source_sha256": "c4569a54ce7a57546bc3a15e3feef5060c01f6c2c7788848015438a11947e60d", "ja": "わあああぁぁぁ！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "cdccdf21d427d0ac3e5fc783b34602de9e8e546518e38e700d7b7268027563de", "ja": "みんなでつくるステージ……それが、それこそがっ！\n奇跡のたまものでしたっ！　ありさ、感激ですーっ！！", "zh": "和大家一起打造的舞台……这就是、这真的就是！\n所谓的奇迹啊！亚利沙超级感动的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1003_p", "source_sha256": "831481e9c6d6721537f6f989cfc4407f1c3f04b935e10e799fd9bcf79a5e2f0c", "ja": "（亜利沙の初センター公演は、大盛り上がりだった！\n会場の熱が、舞台袖まで伝わってくる……）", "zh": "（亚利沙的首次Center公演气氛非常热烈！\n连在舞台侧边都感受得到整个会场的热度……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "e26246257e2a885b149903617e4dc9c86bb47b0400bb8b99ddc312755fbd39b8", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまですっ！\nあああ、ありさは、ありさは……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n亚亚亚、亚利沙、亚利沙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "fc8eb6a6caebcff0e4456aef489c2476bfa430db797da43d47e8e1abff4c6bc3", "ja": "う、うえぇ～ん！！　ありさに、ありさに\nセンターやらせてくれるなんて……感激ですー！", "zh": "呜、呜哇～！！亚利沙、亚利沙\n能有这个机会担任Center……真是太感动了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fa0d4af1c0c898f2fb832788e9961b5f957e98b23c5082ebb4c2b3fbc6e7ba1b", "ja": "はは、そうか。でも掛け値なしに、\nいいステージだったぞ。よくやったな、亜利沙！", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。不过，我发自内心觉得，\n这是一场很棒的表演。做得好，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "dadadcd700b05bf3891b38a0e5cc116a4109bbd14821689b33f53491c020dcdb", "ja": "ありさーっ！", "zh": "亚利沙──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "3964c901024238481acf4c7e4e1eb18bcf26298d5a712b53811a34ac80aa6182", "ja": "亜利沙、さん……。", "zh": "亚利沙、姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "d369eada76cc84655279c0907b99406aa702e3e1922cad69dc40a908ccae2ec2", "ja": "環ちゃん、杏奈ちゃん！\nふたりとも、今日はありがとうございました！", "zh": "小环、杏奈！\n今天谢谢你们俩了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "3bf8064d6716c98c1883d375af76b8b36c4358fed75e74d312a588f9647f9693", "ja": "ありさ、たまき今日すっごく楽しかったぞ！\nまたいっしょにライブしようね！　くふふ♪", "zh": "亚利沙，环今天玩得非常开心喔！\n下次再一起表演吧！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "5edca0acbd63a1991d82695fa88152e41ee3ac825f0dc854940b3a07e59d99bd", "ja": "杏奈もね……楽しかった、よ……。亜利沙さん……\n本当に、アイドルが好きなんだって……思った……。", "zh": "杏奈也……觉得很开心，哦……真的感受到……\n亚利沙姊有多喜欢……偶像了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "91635e90bea06e1c55505256f4fb2a3d2c01e3df6dcac6f6fe5e4e919e0a77f3", "ja": "ふぐぅっ！！！　ありさこそ……\nありさこそ、本当にありがとうございましたっ……！", "zh": "呼唔！！！亚利沙才……\n亚利沙才是，真的很谢谢你们……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "cc47006ef293ff2cef8a2a6688995fa9e6522c325aaa7593b0079df549ab55fd", "ja": "ふたりとも、すっごくかわいかったですよぉ～！！\nいえ、いつもカワイイんですけど、今日はまた一段と！", "zh": "你们两位都超级可爱的喔～！！\n啊，是平时就很可爱，但今天又格外动人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "206fb85e22840824da64e067c22e19e8f08b40004421df4ca2f994aa93900bed", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん！　「亜利沙さん」なんて他人行儀ではなく\n亜利沙と呼んでください！　さぁ、コールマイネーム！", "zh": "杏奈！别用「亚利沙姊」这种有距离的称呼，\n直接叫我亚利沙吧！来，Call my name！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "6e3fc7a2c46ddc7a332358f6b6f1cc3b056e643982846084c0182092693e8dba", "ja": "え……じ、じゃあ……「亜利沙」……？", "zh": "咦……那、那就……「亚利沙」……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "a21056f966e4dec9edda4413fd1c336f8a36251c7a0d81094049291b52088cdc", "ja": "ふぉぉぉっ！！　杏奈ちゃんからの「亜利沙」呼び……\nさ、最高です～っ！！", "zh": "呼喔喔喔！！杏奈嘴里说出来的「亚利沙」……\n太、太棒了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "3e5805b1295dadd1efcce4d2e580b2fe6423e01546cf3159525c8d01a165e761", "ja": "……。亜利沙って……。", "zh": "……亚利沙真是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "bb8d4665e80a6d867f7acfa4927c5c1f75b65a4a8896ac54291a667aa05c0a21", "ja": "くふふ！　ありさって、なんかおもしろい！\nね、おやぶん！", "zh": "呵呵！亚利沙感觉真有趣！\n是吧，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1019_p", "source_sha256": "815046be036946b933b5d53f008927233259d65f345d4d51ae3a309af88a8e44", "ja": "そうだな……。\nでも、今のは見習わなくていいぞ？", "zh": "对啊……\n但你可别学她刚刚那样喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "287ade220c53d3c8d62bf876dbd075264a49ad855302213e6db88ff0de0148ae", "ja": "亜利沙、初センターお疲れさま！　良かったわよ！\nやるじゃない♪", "zh": "亚利沙，第一次当Center辛苦了！表演很精采喔！\n你挺厉害的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "24ffa63aac626b44f30db2eaeddea4b7272c32d28c8946161e4c101a2b6d1743", "ja": "律子センパイ！　あわわ、律子センパイにそんなふうに\n言ってもらえるとは……ありさ、感無量ですっ……！", "zh": "律子前辈！啊哇哇，居然能得到律子前辈的称赞……\n亚利沙真是感动万分……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1323070567ec37aee5769310e54996030643b60154cac0a7eb3cd79111b91abc", "ja": "わ、私も、すごくいいステージだったと思う！\n亜利沙ちゃん、素敵な時間をありがとう……♪", "zh": "我、我也觉得表演非常精采！\n亚利沙，谢谢你带给我们这么美好的时光……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "ca8d2c5d6444de3dad88c7690478a42fcbd019f50d6393f2377e19827a03b5ad", "ja": "ええっ！？\nか、感謝するのはありさのほうですよ、雪歩ちゃん！", "zh": "咦咦！？\n要、要说谢谢的人是亚利沙才对啦，雪步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "d35f6aa748d930837c18d3a69da9095be1d9f84cbd6f55a2b560ac328745c8d8", "ja": "くうっ、雪歩ちゃんのエベレスト級スマイル……\nムフ、ムフ……フ……♪", "zh": "唔呜，雪步的圣母峰级微笑……\n唔呼、唔呼……呼……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1025_p", "source_sha256": "78b89540c7c30582eb2b7cb06955b7d6d134455ebc175f25eeb078ad6a4d744a", "ja": "あっ、亜利沙？　大丈夫か！？\n亜利沙ーっ！！", "zh": "亚、亚利沙？你没事吧！？\n亚利沙──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "cb1d966465ef703dd3806790db86029744637e7598a1eff130190d5b96380a44", "ja": "はっ！？　だ、大丈夫です！\nちょっとお花畑が見えちゃっただけです！", "zh": "啊！？没、没事！\n亚利沙只是看到了天堂一下而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1027_p", "source_sha256": "50e0f8aa021fd1d92b787d9e16fcff9612b2c45abb403d14816b51cb06c53194", "ja": "そ、そうか……驚いたけど、まあ大丈夫ならよかった。", "zh": "这、这样啊……真是吓人，但你没事就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "ae13e2ee37dfbbcb198884e8e9a540146c6da569dc17eca34a061faaf6e5cd57", "ja": "{$P$}さん、みんな……。\n本当に本当に、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生、各位……\n真的真的，非常感谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "3ae085b06698fd1a81c175a574419a0cba498995500fc5f9e2d5a0c29172994a", "ja": "みんながいなかったら……ありさだけじゃ、\nこんなにも楽しいステージはできなかったです！", "zh": "如果没有你们……只靠亚利沙，\n是没办法做出这么欢乐的表演的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_024_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "78137055a3244127dc7dbb2f2247f9c1420a33bd1d42ded1ef9575252fea80ad", "ja": "ありさ、今日のことは一生忘れないです！\nこれからもありさのこと、よろしくお願いします～！！", "zh": "亚利沙，这辈子都不会忘了今天的事！\n今后还请大家多多关照亚利沙了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
